            "content": "<font color='green'>**[ Success: 2/6 Units ]**</font>  <font color='red'>**[ Failed: 4/6 Units ]**</font>  <font color='orange'>**[ Priority: F13 ]**</font>\n\n- **Priority Unit (10.81.160.242)**: S/N `AS2440130330` on F13 showing <font color='red'>**\"Unknown\"**</font> firmware status.\n- **Root Cause**: Upgrading NMC first (Boot Monitor `v2.5.5.1`) disrupts communication. Upgrading UPS firmware *before* NMC succeeds."
          }
        },
